``` Source Source 5 : CareElderly_Custom_Policy_XYZ_General.pdf (page: 49)``` XYZ Company Survivorship & Waiver of Premium Benefit Optional Rider This Rider waives Your premiums if Your Partner dies or claims after a 10-year claim-free period. This Rider is part of Your Policy. Subject to Policy provisions unless stated differently below. Your Partner refers to the individual named in the application or form. THE SURVIVORSHIP BENEFIT AND HOW IT WORKS Survivorship Benefit If Your Partner dies, Your Policy will be paid up without further premiums if all conditions are met: e no benefits (except for Helping Hand Services) were paid to You or Your Partner during the first 10 years the policies were inforce; e on the date of death, both had individual CareElderly insurance policies inforce with Us for 10 consecutive full years; and e on the date of death, the Rider had been inforce for at least 10 years. Proof of death required for benefit provision. Premiums won't be waived for benefits added post-death under this Rider. XYZ-SURV 1 

``` Source Source 6 : CareElderly_Custom_Policy_XYZ_General.pdf (page: 43)``` WAIVER OF PREMIUM Waiver of Premium We will only apply the Waiver of Premium in Your Policy if receiving benefits under Your Policy. No waiver for Partner's benefits. RESTORATION OF BENEFITS Restoration of Benefits Optional Rider doesn't extend to this "Rider. If attached to Your Policy, Policy Limit restores to extent of Your accessed benefits under provisions. Partner's used benefits won't be restored. TERMINATION This Rider won't affect Your Policy, except benefits paid under it on behalf of Partner subtract from Policy Limit. Ends upon Policy's end or under nonforfeiture benefit. Additionally terminates on these dates: e Your or Partner’s death; e Shared Benefit Rider termination on Partner's policy for reasons other than benefits exhaustion; e benefits exhausted under both policies; or e Policy revision altering benefit levels or options excluding increases by Guaranteed Purchase Option, if included. Signed by Company: Secretary XYZ-SHC 3

